IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sga1-redeemable`

-- Tests for sga1-redeemable.l4 (s 70). Every expected value is written from the text of the section, beside the assertion.
-- Arguments are positional, in the order of each function's GIVEN.

§ `Section 70: redeemable preference shares`

-- (1) Arguments: the company has a share capital; the constitution authorises the issue of redeemable preference shares.
#ASSERT `s 70(1) the company may issue preference shares that are liable to be redeemed` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the "if so authorised" gate is unmet: the text does not say the company may not
#ASSERT `s 70(1) the company may issue preference shares that are liable to be redeemed` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 70(1) the company may issue preference shares that are liable to be redeemed` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Arguments: the shares are redeemable preference shares; the redemption is effected on the terms and in the manner provided by the constitution.
#ASSERT `s 70(1) the redemption may be effected` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "only on such terms and in such manner"
#ASSERT `s 70(1) the redemption may be effected` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 70(1) the redemption may be effected` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (3) Arguments: the shares are redeemable preference shares; they are fully paid up.
#ASSERT `s 70(3) the company is barred from redeeming the shares` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 70(3) the company is barred from redeeming the shares` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 70(3) the company is barred from redeeming the shares` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 70(3) a company must not redeem shares that are not fully paid up` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 70(3) redeem shares that are not fully paid up` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 70(3) a company must not redeem shares that are not fully paid up` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH

-- (4) A statement the directors made for this redemption that has the content and the form s 7A requires.
-- Fields in order: the proposal; the date; made by the directors; no ground to be found unable to pay debts; pay in full within 12 months of winding up; pay debts as they fall due for 12 months;
-- assets not less than liabilities; assets will not after the proposal become less than liabilities; the directors intend to wind up within 12 months; number of directors; number who signed; auditor's report accompanies it.
`s 70(4) a statement made out as the section requires, signed by all 3 directors` MEANS `Solvency statement` OF `a redemption of preference shares out of capital under section 70`, Date 1 3 2026, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 3, 3, FALSE
`s 70(4) a statement signed by 2 of 3 directors with an auditor's report` MEANS `Solvency statement` OF `a redemption of preference shares out of capital under section 70`, Date 1 3 2026, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 3, 2, TRUE
`s 70(4) a statement signed by 2 of 3 directors with no auditor's report` MEANS `Solvency statement` OF `a redemption of preference shares out of capital under section 70`, Date 1 3 2026, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 3, 2, FALSE
`s 70(4) a statement made out for another proposal` MEANS `Solvency statement` OF `a giving of financial assistance under section 76(9A) or (9B)`, Date 1 3 2026, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 3, 3, FALSE
`s 70(4) a statement that omits the opinion about the future value of assets` MEANS `Solvency statement` OF `a redemption of preference shares out of capital under section 70`, Date 1 3 2026, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 3, 3, FALSE

-- Arguments: redeemed out of the capital of the company; the statement; the company is exempt from audit under section 205B or 205C; all the directors have made the statement; a copy has been lodged with the Registrar.
#ASSERT `s 70(4) the company is barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` TRUE `s 70(4) a statement made out as the section requires, signed by all 3 directors` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b) the copy has not been lodged; (a) not all the directors made it
#ASSERT `s 70(4) the company is barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` TRUE `s 70(4) a statement made out as the section requires, signed by all 3 directors` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 70(4) the company is barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` TRUE `s 70(4) a statement made out as the section requires, signed by all 3 directors` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a statement made for another proposal is not "in relation to such redemption"
#ASSERT `s 70(4) the company is barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` TRUE `s 70(4) a statement made out for another proposal` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a company that is not exempt may use the auditor's report instead of every director's signature (s 7A(2)(b))
#ASSERT `s 70(4) the company is barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` TRUE `s 70(4) a statement signed by 2 of 3 directors with an auditor's report` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 70(4) the company is barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` TRUE `s 70(4) a statement signed by 2 of 3 directors with no auditor's report` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an exempt company needs every director's signature (s 7A(2)(a)): the auditor's report does not help
#ASSERT `s 70(4) the company is barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` TRUE `s 70(4) a statement signed by 2 of 3 directors with an auditor's report` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 70(4) the company is barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` TRUE `s 70(4) a statement made out as the section requires, signed by all 3 directors` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a statement without the opinion s 7A(1)(c) requires is not a solvency statement
#ASSERT `s 70(4) the company is barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` TRUE `s 70(4) a statement that omits the opinion about the future value of assets` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not redeemed out of capital: not covered
#ASSERT `s 70(4) the company is barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` FALSE `s 70(4) a statement made out as the section requires, signed by all 3 directors` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 70(4) a company must not redeem shares out of capital without a solvency statement made by all the directors and lodged` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 70(4) redeem shares out of capital without a solvency statement made by all the directors and lodged` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 70(4) a company must not redeem shares out of capital without a solvency statement made by all the directors and lodged` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH

-- (5) Argument: redeemed out of the proceeds of a fresh issue issued for the purpose of redemption.
#ASSERT `s 70(5) the shares are treated as redeemed out of the capital of the company` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 70(5) the shares are treated as redeemed out of the capital of the company` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (6) Arguments: private company; redeemable preference shares; a prescribed notice of redemption has been lodged.
#ASSERT `s 70(6) the private company may redeem the shares by lodging the notice` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 70(6) the private company may redeem the shares by lodging the notice` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 70(6) the private company may redeem the shares by lodging the notice` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 70(6) the private company may redeem the shares by lodging the notice` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (7) Arguments: private company; the day of the redemption; the register has been updated under section 196A(5).
#ASSERT `s 70(7) the redemption has not yet taken effect` TRUE (Date 5 3 2016) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 70(7) the redemption has not yet taken effect` TRUE (Date 5 3 2016) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 70(7) the redemption has not yet taken effect` TRUE (Date 3 1 2016) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- before 3 January 2016, or a public company: not covered
#ASSERT `s 70(7) the redemption has not yet taken effect` TRUE (Date 2 1 2016) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 70(7) the redemption has not yet taken effect` FALSE (Date 5 3 2016) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (8) Arguments: public company; it has redeemed redeemable preference shares; the day of the redemption; notice has been given; the day it was given; the notice specifies the shares redeemed; the day on which the question is asked.
-- redeemed on 1 March 2026: the 14th day is 15 March 2026
#ASSERT `s 70(8) the public company is in default of the duty to give notice to the Registrar of the redemption` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 70(8) the public company is in default of the duty to give notice to the Registrar of the redemption` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 16 3 2026) TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- in time but the notice does not specify the shares redeemed
#ASSERT `s 70(8) the public company is in default of the duty to give notice to the Registrar of the redemption` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no notice yet: the 14 days have run out, or have not
#ASSERT `s 70(8) the public company is in default of the duty to give notice to the Registrar of the redemption` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 16 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 70(8) the public company is in default of the duty to give notice to the Registrar of the redemption` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the "If" gate: a private company, or no redemption: the duty does not arise
#ASSERT `s 70(8) the public company is in default of the duty to give notice to the Registrar of the redemption` FALSE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 70(8) the public company is in default of the duty to give notice to the Registrar of the redemption` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 70(8) a public company must give notice to the Registrar of the redemption within 14 days` "Acme Public Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Public Ltd" DOES `s 70(8) give notice to the Registrar specifying the shares redeemed` AT 14

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 70(8) a public company must give notice to the Registrar of the redemption within 14 days` "Acme Public Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Public Ltd" DOES `s 70(8) give notice to the Registrar specifying the shares redeemed` AT 15

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 70(8) a public company must give notice to the Registrar of the redemption within 14 days` "Acme Public Ltd" AT 0 WITH
